ame fighting back when Dobe is trashing Nagoya so much? And Rara-sensei's green tea from Shizuoka is stolen goods?!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dBmcl5asRGGmYvPc3hFfbZ6UrWp.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"When Dobe learns that Yatogame loves Nagoya, she pities her to the point of tears. She invites her to leave Nagoya and relocate to Tokyo with her, but wait... that uniform Dobe's wearing... She attends middle school in Ichimiya, which is just outside Nagoya? Why isn't Yatogame fighting back when Dobe is trashing Nagoya so much? And Rara-sensei's green tea from Shizuoka is stolen goods?!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dBmcl5asRGGmYvPc3hFfbZ6UrWp.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15741","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124394","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42959","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"87473","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"360553","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"50099","synopsis":"Jin's sister, Toshika, has come to an udon restaurant for lunch. Inside she spots Yatogame and a girl that she assumes is one of her minions. Part of their conversation that she overhears involves the words \"scum\" and \"kill\"?! Terrified, Toshika runs out of the restaurant and tries a Chinese place instead... but once again, she runs into Yatogame and her minion! are there illegal substances in the chilled Chinese noodles?! This is getting scary...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/abOFMG6OJvIwUPfYvJ6bheCnP1q.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Jin's sister, Toshika, has come to an udon restaurant for lunch. Inside she spots Yatogame and a girl that she assumes is one of her minions.